## 四、实现顺序

按依赖关系递增，每个阶段后可编译验证：

```
1. ZZZGameplayTags.h/.cpp           [无依赖 — 所有其他文件的基础]
2. ZZZInputConfig.h                 [依赖 GameplayTags]
3. AnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent     [依赖 GameplayTags]
4. AnimNotifyState_AbilityWindow    [依赖 GameplayTags]
5. AbilityTask_WaitInputBuffer      [依赖 GameplayTags]
6. AbilityTask_WaitCombo            [依赖 GameplayTags]
7. ZZZGameplayAbility               [依赖 GameplayTags]
8. ZZZBasicAttack                   [依赖 1-7 全部]
9. ZZZCharacter 修改                [依赖 InputConfig]
```

编译验证点：第 1 步后；第 8 步后；第 9 步后。

