## 五、核心 GameplayTag 表

| Tag 字符串 | C++ 常量名 | 用途 |
|---|---|---|
| `Input.Attack` | `Input_Attack` | Enhanced Input → ASC GameplayEvent |
| `Input.Buffered.Attack` | `Input_Buffered_Attack` | WaitInputBuffer 写入，WaitCombo 消费 |
| `Ability.Attack.Basic` | `Ability_Attack_Basic` | 标识普攻 Ability（AbilityTags + AbilityTriggers） |
| `Effect.Ability.CanCombo` | `Effect_Ability_CanCombo` | AnimNotifyState_AbilityWindow 管理 |
| `Event.AnimNotify.BeginInputBuffer` | `Event_AnimNotify_BeginInputBuffer` | AnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent 广播 |

---

## 六、关键类设计

### 6.1 `UAnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent` — 通用事件广播

```cpp
UCLASS(meta = (DisplayName = "Send Gameplay Event"))
class UAnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent : public UAnimNotify
{
    GENERATED_BODY()

public:
    virtual void Notify(USkeletalMeshComponent* MeshComp, UAnimSequenceBase* Animation,
        const FAnimNotifyEventReference& EventReference) override;
    virtual FString GetNotifyName_Implementation() const override;

    // 动画师从下拉菜单选 Tag
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Gameplay Event")
    FGameplayTag EventTag;

    // 可选上下文对象（未来扩展：如传伤害 GE 引用）
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Gameplay Event")
    TObjectPtr<UObject> OptionalPayload;
};
```

`Notify()` 核心逻辑：

```cpp
void UAnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent::Notify(...)
{
    if (!MeshComp || !EventTag.IsValid()) return;

    AActor* Owner = MeshComp->GetOwner();
    if (IAbilitySystemInterface* ASI = Cast<IAbilitySystemInterface>(Owner))
    {
        if (UAbilitySystemComponent* ASC = ASI->GetAbilitySystemComponent())
        {
            FGameplayEventData EventData;
            EventData.Instigator = Owner;
            EventData.OptionalObject = OptionalPayload;
            ASC->HandleGameplayEvent(EventTag, &EventData);
        }
    }
}
```

### 6.2 `UAnimNotifyState_AbilityWindow` — 连段窗口标记

```cpp
UCLASS(meta = (DisplayName = "Ability Window"))
class UAnimNotifyState_AbilityWindow : public UAnimNotifyState
{
    GENERATED_BODY()

public:
    virtual void NotifyBegin(USkeletalMeshComponent* MeshComp, UAnimSequenceBase* Animation,
        float TotalDuration, const FAnimNotifyEventReference& EventReference) override;
    virtual void NotifyEnd(USkeletalMeshComponent* MeshComp, UAnimSequenceBase* Animation,
        const FAnimNotifyEventReference& EventReference) override;

    // 允许未来扩展不同窗口类型（如 Effect.Ability.CanParry）
    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = "Ability Window")
    FGameplayTag WindowTag;
};
```

实现：

```
NotifyBegin() → ASC->AddLooseGameplayTag(WindowTag)
NotifyEnd()   → ASC->RemoveLooseGameplayTag(WindowTag)
```

动画师将此 NotifyState 拖到 Montage Recovery 段的完整时长上。蓝色条 = 连段可触发区间。

### 6.3 `UAbilityTask_WaitInputBuffer` — 输入缓冲（事件驱动状态机）

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              WaitInputBuffer 状态机               │
│                                                  │
│  Activate()                                      │
│    → 注册两个 ASC GameplayEvent 回调:             │
│       A) Event.AnimNotify.BeginInputBuffer       │
│          → OnBufferReady()                       │
│       B) Input.Attack                             │
│          → OnInputPressed()                      │
│    → bIsListening = false（初始死区）              │
│                                                  │
│  OnBufferReady(Tag)                              │
│    → bIsListening = true   // 死区结束             │
│                                                  │
│  OnInputPressed(Tag)                             │
│    if (!bIsListening) return;  // 死区，吞掉       │
│    ASC->AddLooseGameplayTag(Input.Buffered.Attack)│
│    OnInputReceived.Broadcast()                   │
│                                                  │
│  OnDestroy()                                     │
│    → 清理两个 DelegateHandle                      │
│    → ASC->RemoveLooseGameplayTag(Buffered)        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

关键设计决策：**不继承 `UAbilityTask_WaitGameplayEvent`**。原因是需要同时监听两个不同的 GameplayEvent（BeginInputBuffer + Input.Attack），它们的触发时机和语义完全不同。自注册两个 `GenericGameplayEventCallbacks` 更直接。

### 6.4 `UAbilityTask_WaitCombo` — 连段检查（Tick 轮询）

```cpp
UCLASS()
class UAbilityTask_WaitCombo : public UAbilityTask
{
    GENERATED_BODY()

public:
    UPROPERTY(BlueprintAssignable)
    FWaitComboDelegate OnComboTriggered;

    static UAbilityTask_WaitCombo* WaitCombo(
        UGameplayAbility* OwningAbility,
        FGameplayTag InComboWindowTag,
        FGameplayTag InBufferedInputTag);

    virtual void TickTask(float DeltaTime) override;

protected:
    FGameplayTag ComboWindowTag;    // Effect.Ability.CanCombo
    FGameplayTag BufferedInputTag;  // Input.Buffered.Attack
};
```

```cpp
void UAbilityTask_WaitCombo::TickTask(float DeltaTime)
{
    UAbilitySystemComponent* ASC = GetTargetASC();
    if (!ASC) return;

    if (ASC->HasMatchingGameplayTag(ComboWindowTag)
        && ASC->HasMatchingGameplayTag(BufferedInputTag))
    {
        // 消费缓冲 Tag（防止同一输入触发两次连段）
        ASC->RemoveLooseGameplayTag(BufferedInputTag);
        OnComboTriggered.Broadcast();
    }
}
```

选择 Tick 轮询而非事件驱动的原因：`HasMatchingGameplayTag` 对 Loose Tag 是 O(1) 哈希查找，每帧开销可忽略。事件驱动需要同时监听 CanCombo 和 Buffered 两个 Tag 的添加事件，实现复杂度更高且不带来实际收益。

### 6.5 `UZZZGameplayAbility` — 项目 Ability 基类

```cpp
UCLASS(abstract)
class UZZZGameplayAbility : public UGameplayAbility
{
    GENERATED_BODY()

public:
    UZZZGameplayAbility();

    // 便捷访问
    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = "ZZZ|Ability")
    UAbilitySystemComponent* GetZZZASC() const;

    // 连段序号（1-based，由 BP 子类配置）
    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, BlueprintReadOnly, Category = "ZZZ|Combo")
    int32 ComboIndex = 1;

    // 下一段 Ability 类（末段为 null）
    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, BlueprintReadOnly, Category = "ZZZ|Combo")
    TSubclassOf<UZZZBasicAttack> NextComboAbility;

    // 本段攻击 Montage
    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, BlueprintReadOnly, Category = "ZZZ|Animation")
    TObjectPtr<UAnimMontage> AttackMontage;
};
```

### 6.6 `UZZZBasicAttack` — 连段 Ability（核心编排器）

这是整个系统最核心的类，负责启动和协调三个 AbilityTask。

```cpp
UCLASS(abstract)
class UZZZBasicAttack : public UZZZGameplayAbility
{
    GENERATED_BODY()

public:
    virtual void ActivateAbility(const FGameplayAbilitySpecHandle Handle,
        const FGameplayAbilityActorInfo* ActorInfo,
        const FGameplayAbilityActivationInfo ActivationInfo,
        const FGameplayEventData* TriggerEventData) override;

    virtual void EndAbility(const FGameplayAbilitySpecHandle Handle,
        const FGameplayAbilityActorInfo* ActorInfo,
        const FGameplayAbilityActivationInfo ActivationInfo,
        bool bReplicateEndAbility, bool bWasCancelled) override;

protected:
    UFUNCTION()
    void OnMontageCompleted();

    UFUNCTION()
    void OnComboTriggered();

    void CheckComboTransition();

    // 三个受管理的 Task
    UPROPERTY()
    TObjectPtr<UAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWait> MontageTask;

    UPROPERTY()
    TObjectPtr<UAbilityTask_WaitInputBuffer> InputBufferTask;

    UPROPERTY()
    TObjectPtr<UAbilityTask_WaitCombo> ComboCheckTask;
};
```

`ActivateAbility()` 实现：

```cpp
void UZZZBasicAttack::ActivateAbility(...)
{
    Super::ActivateAbility(Handle, ActorInfo, ActivationInfo, TriggerEventData);
    CommitAbility(Handle, ActorInfo, ActivationInfo);

    // 1. 播放 Montage
    MontageTask = UAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWait::CreatePlayMontageAndWaitProxy(
        this, NAME_None, AttackMontage, 1.0f, NAME_None, false);
    MontageTask->OnCompleted.AddDynamic(this, &UZZZBasicAttack::OnMontageCompleted);
    MontageTask->OnBlendOut.AddDynamic(this, &UZZZBasicAttack::OnMontageCompleted);
    MontageTask->ReadyForActivation();

    // 2. 启动输入缓冲（初始处于死区）
    InputBufferTask = UAbilityTask_WaitInputBuffer::WaitInputBuffer(
        this, ZZZGameplayTags::Input_Buffered_Attack);
    InputBufferTask->ReadyForActivation();

    // 3. 启动连段窗口检查
    ComboCheckTask = UAbilityTask_WaitCombo::WaitCombo(
        this,
        ZZZGameplayTags::Effect_Ability_CanCombo,
        ZZZGameplayTags::Input_Buffered_Attack);
    ComboCheckTask->OnComboTriggered.AddDynamic(this, &UZZZBasicAttack::OnComboTriggered);
    ComboCheckTask->ReadyForActivation();
}
```

`CheckComboTransition()` — **关键顺序**（设计文档第 8.3 节）：

```cpp
void UZZZBasicAttack::CheckComboTransition()
{
    UAbilitySystemComponent* ASC = GetAbilitySystemComponentFromActorInfo();
    if (!ASC || !NextComboAbility) return;

    // ⚠ 顺序至关重要:
    // 1. 先激活下一段 Ability — 新 Montage BlendIn 覆盖当前收刀动画
    ASC->TryActivateAbilityByClass(NextComboAbility);

    // 2. 再结束当前 Ability — 下一段 Montage 已在 BlendIn 中
    EndAbility(CurrentSpecHandle, CurrentActorInfo, CurrentActivationInfo, true, false);
}
```

**为什么先激活再结束**：如果先 `EndAbility` 再 `TryActivateAbilityByClass`，Montage BlendOut 和 BlendIn 之间会有 1-2 帧空窗，角色短暂回到 Idle 姿态再切下一段。先激活下一段，新 Montage 的 BlendIn 直接覆盖当前收刀段，无感知过渡。

---

## 七、Montage 时间轴结构

```
AM_BasicAttack_N（每个 Montage 一个 Attack + Recovery 双 Section）

┌──── Section:Attack ────────────────────┬──── Section:Recovery ────────────┐
│                                         │                                  │
│  [死区 — WaitInputBuffer 忽略输入]       │  [AbilityWindow NotifyState]      │
│                                         │  Effect.Ability.CanCombo ON       │
│  ★ AnimNotify_AttackTrace               │                                  │
│    (伤害检测帧)                          │  玩家在此时按键 →                  │
│                                         │  Buffered.Attack 已写入           │
│  ★ AnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent         │  ↓                               │
│    Event.AnimNotify.BeginInputBuffer    │  WaitCombo::TickTask 检测到       │
│    ← 死区结束，缓冲窗口从此帧开启         │  → CheckComboTransition()         │
│                                         │  → 激活 GA_BasicAttack_N+1        │
│                                         │                                  │
│  Root Motion: ON ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**规则**：
- 每段攻击一个独立 Montage（非单 Montage 多 Section 跳转）
- Recovery 段全程嵌入 `AnimNotifyState_AbilityWindow`
- `AnimNotify_SendGameplayEvent(BeginInputBuffer)` 在伤害帧 **之后** 2-3 帧放置
- Root Motion 在整个 Montage（Attack + Recovery）期间全程开启
- BlendIn 时长建议 0.05-0.1s（短到几乎感知不到但足以覆盖收刀）

**不同攻击段的死区差异（纯动画侧配置）**：

| Montage | BeginInputBuffer 位置 | 原因 |
|---------|----------------------|------|
| AM_BasicAttack_01 | 伤害帧后约 0.25s | 起手式，死区长 |
| AM_BasicAttack_02 | 伤害帧后约 0.15s | 连段中，节奏加快 |
| AM_BasicAttack_03 | 伤害帧后约 0.12s | 更紧凑 |
| AM_BasicAttack_04 | 不放置（无下一段） | 末段 |

所有调整通过拖动 Notify 时间轴完成，不涉及任何代码或 DataAsset 改动。

