```
Content/ZZZ/Abilities/
├── GA_BasicAttack_01.uasset
├── GA_BasicAttack_02.uasset
├── GA_BasicAttack_03.uasset
└── GA_BasicAttack_04.uasset
```

| 属性 | GA_01 | GA_02 | GA_03 | GA_04 |
|------|-------|-------|-------|-------|
| Parent Class | `UZZZBasicAttack` | ← 同 | ← 同 | ← 同 |
| ComboIndex | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 |
| NextComboAbility | GA_02 | GA_03 | GA_04 | None |
| AttackMontage | AM_BasicAttack_01 | AM_BasicAttack_02 | AM_BasicAttack_03 | AM_BasicAttack_04 |
| AbilityTags | `Ability.Attack.Basic` | ← 同 | ← 同 | ← 同 |
| AbilityTriggers[0].TriggerTag | `Input.Attack` | ← 同 | ← 同 | ← 同 |

### 9.3 AnimMontage（4 个）

用珂蕾妲现有动画资源创建 4 个 Montage，每个含双 Section + Notify 标记。

